rsational pace, and wear shoes suited to dirt or mulch.","short_summary":"Use a documented neighborhood loop for a free social walk.","evidence_claim":"The City says Barry Park adjoins the Meadowbrook Detention Basin and its 1.2-mile dirt-and-mulched walking and jogging path.","source_url":"https://www.syr.gov/Living/Our-Community/Parks-Recreation-Youth-Services/Visit-Our-Parks/Barry-Park","source_title":"Barry Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":43.030234,"longitude":-76.118016,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public city park open daily from dawn to dusk. The unreserved walking route requires no purchase; check conditions after wet weather.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"upper-onondaga-hiawatha-lake","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Upper Onondaga Park","title":"Circle Hiawatha Lake and the Gazebo","subtitle":"A scenic group walk in Syracuse’s Strathmore neighborhood","notes":"Meet near the lake, walk toward the island gazebo, and use the public park’s paths and picnic tables without booking a pavilion.","short_summary":"Build a relaxed outing around Hiawatha Lake’s landmarks.","evidence_claim":"The City describes Upper Onondaga Park as a 67-acre public park containing Hiawatha Lake, an island gazebo, picnic tables, and recreation courts.","source_url":"https://www.syr.gov/Living/Our-Community/Parks-Recreation-Youth-Services/Visit-Our-Parks/Onondaga-Park-Upper","source_title":"Onondaga Park - Upper","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":43.0259849,"longitude":-76.1673247,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public city park open daily from dawn to dusk. Casual walking and sitting require no purchase; reservations and pool programs are separate.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"erie-canal-museum-self-guided","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Erie Canal Museum","title":"Explore the Historic Weighlock Together","subtitle":"A self-guided downtown Syracuse museum visit","notes":"Walk through the 1850 Weighlock Building and compare notes on the canal artifacts; choose zero dollars under pay-what-you-wish admission.","short_summary":"Turn local transportation history into a free group museum visit.","evidence_claim":"The museum states that general admission is pay what you wish and describes the museum as open seven days a week with free admission.","source_url":"https://eriecanalmuseum.org/visit/","source_title":"Visit - Erie Canal Museum","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"General admission may be $0 under the current pay-what-you-wish policy. Special exhibitions, group tours, and guided tours may charge fees.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
